  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/e306d0edaa1c360a9dc63af39b3f34da9440d14853e714d54d6553647fbc3ba8.png] \n\nGiven equation: 4 × 2 ÷ 6 - 3 + 1 = ?\n\n \n \n\n Signs\n Interchanged Signs\n \n \n\n +\n -\n \n \n\n -\n +\n \n \n\n ×\n ÷\n \n \n\n ÷\n ×\n \n \n\n \n\n⇒ __**4 ÷ 2**__ × 6 + 3 - 1 = ?\n\n⇒ ? = __2____** ×**____** 6**__ + 3 - 1\n\n⇒ ? = **__12__****__ + 3__** - 1\n\n⇒ ? = __15__**__ - 1__** = **14**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"14\".",
